  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\begin{aligned} & \\mathrm{W}=\\mathrm{ZIt} \\\\ & \\mathrm{W}=\\mathrm{ZQ} \\\\ & \\mathrm{Q}=\\frac{\\mathrm{W}}{\\mathrm{Z}} \\\\ & \\mathrm{W}=\\mathrm{ZQ}=\\text { (electrochemical equivalent) }\\end{aligned}$"
